# Scale for the Kosmos CP1 tone generator on Port 4: plays the notes 1 to 13 (one octave), then starts again.
# Start: 000 PC RUN
# Cell 020 holds the note, cell 021 the last note.

000 ako 04.001
001 abs 06.020
002 lda 05.020
003 p4a 23.000
004 anz 02.000
005 vzg 03.200
006 ako 04.000
007 p4a 23.000
008 vzg 03.040
009 lda 05.020
010 vgl 10.021
011 spb 11.000
012 ako 04.001
013 add 07.020
014 abs 06.020
015 spu 09.002
021     00.013
